{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">BASE64-ENCODE function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":939,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/308929","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/BASE64-ENCODE-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/BASE64-ENCODE-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"BASE64-ENCODE-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">BASE64-ENCODE function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"BASE64-ENCODE-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Converts binary data into a Base64 character\nstring, and returns a LONGCHAR containing the character data. The\nresulting LONGCHAR is in the code page specified by <code class=\"ph codeph\">-cpinternal</code>.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"BASE64-ENCODE-function__syntax_GC154L2680128\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d445431e99\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"BASE64-ENCODE-function__idGDE1XJ2662234\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>BASE64-ENCODE ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A MEMPTR or RAW expression containing the binary data you want\nto convert.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n      <div class=\"note note note_note\" id=\"BASE64-ENCODE-function__note_N1008B_N1002F_N10021_N10001\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> The <code class=\"ph codeph\">BASE64-ENCODE</code>,\n          <code class=\"ph codeph\">BASE64-DECODE</code>, <code class=\"ph codeph\">HEX-ENCODE</code>, and\n          <code class=\"ph codeph\">HEX-DECODE</code> functions do not do any byte ordering. However, the binary\n        output of these functions may be a binary data type such as a MEMPTR or RAW. If the target\n        of these operation’s output is another system where the order of bytes (endianness) differs,\n        you must first normalize the data to what the receiving side is expecting. Otherwise, the\n        results may not be as expected. For example, for a MEMPTR value that you are building\n        yourself, you can use the <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SET-BYTE-ORDER-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SET-BYTE-ORDER-statement.html\">SET-BYTE-ORDER statement</a> to set the byte order for the\n        MEMPTR variable before you read or write the value.</div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"BASE64-ENCODE-function__example_GC154M2680134\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d445431e162\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">Following is an example using the <code class=\"ph codeph\">BASE64-ENCODE</code>\n        function:</p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"BASE64-ENCODE-function__idGDE1XK2662240\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE encdmptr AS MEMPTR   NO-UNDO.\nDEFINE VARIABLE encdlngc AS LONGCHAR NO-UNDO.\n\nCOPY-LOB FROM FILE &quot;C:\\myicons\\test.ico&quot; TO encdmptr.\nencdlngc = BASE64-ENCODE(encdmptr).\nCOPY-LOB FROM encdlngc TO FILE &quot;C:\\myicons\\testencode&quot;.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"BASE64-ENCODE-function__see-also_GC18PA2694179\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d445431e194\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\"><a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"BASE64-DECODE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/BASE64-DECODE-function.html\">BASE64-DECODE function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SET-BYTE-ORDER-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SET-BYTE-ORDER-statement.html\">SET-BYTE-ORDER statement</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"BASE64-DECODE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/BASE64-DECODE-function.html\">BASE64-DECODE function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"BEGINS-operator.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/BEGINS-operator.html\">BEGINS operator</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/308929","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":938,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"BASE64-ENCODE function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/BASE64-ENCODE-function.html","type":"Manual"}